[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13080.87, "timestamp": "03:38:00", "text": "是的，我会被问到寻求什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13083.91, "timestamp": "03:38:03", "text": "律师。我有一些律师。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13087.429, "timestamp": "03:38:07", "text": "我的房间，呃，不是房间，是隔壁的房间。呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13091.75, "timestamp": "03:38:11", "text": "因为我的……我的房子一楼是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13094.309, "timestamp": "03:38:14", "text": "为出租而提供，就像出租一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13097.59, "timestamp": "03:38:17", "text": "商业空间。其中一个大厅是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13100.07, "timestamp": "03:38:20", "text": "律师们习以为常的事。这是法律。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13102.07, "timestamp": "03:38:22", "text": "它就像一家律师事务所。我不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13104.469, "timestamp": "03:38:24", "text": "他们是哪种类型的律师？嗯。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13106.63, "timestamp": "03:38:26", "text": "好像有四个律师。直接问他们就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13109.269, "timestamp": "03:38:29", "text": "比如，如果我偶然看到他们，我会很自然地跟他们打招呼。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 13110.474, "timestamp": "03:38:30", "author": "@mattmeownster", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_k0PVo4Ayjzf9FlRcdjZAQYBwK430_hLvWlP9jgikQjC65W-ONDWjkk4dykteuHJ96HgQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bro keeps lawyer in his room"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13114.229, "timestamp": "03:38:34", "text": "离开我的房间。嗯，就像你那样，这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13116.15, "timestamp": "03:38:36", "text": "你们能帮帮我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13119.03, "timestamp": "03:38:39", "text": "某物？我觉得我可能不得不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13122.79, "timestamp": "03:38:42", "text": "付钱给他们。我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13126.71, "timestamp": "03:38:46", "text": "好的，我会调查一下。如果他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13129.03, "timestamp": "03:38:49", "text": "或许能帮到我，那将对我有很大帮助。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13137.99, "timestamp": "03:38:57", "text": "是的，他们或许能帮到我。那将"}]